          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 18:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.18.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.18.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " said to me, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.18.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.18.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 18:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Go down to the potter's house, where I will give you my message.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.18.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.18.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 18:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "So I went there and saw the potter working at his wheel. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.18.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.18.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 18:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Whenever a piece of pottery turned out imperfect, he would take the clay and make it into something else.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.18.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.18.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 18:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.18.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.18.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 18:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Then the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.18.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.18.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " said to me, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.18.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.18.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 18:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Haven't I the right to do with you people of Israel what the potter did with the clay? You are in my hands just like clay in the potter's hands. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.18.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.18.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 18:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "If at any time I say that I am going to uproot, break down, or destroy any nation or kingdom, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.18.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.18.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 18:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "but then that nation turns from its evil, I will not do what I said I would. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.18.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.18.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 18:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "On the other hand, if I say that I am going to plant or build up any nation or kingdom, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.18.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.18.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 18:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "but then that nation disobeys me and does evil, I will not do what I said I would. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.18.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.18.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 18:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Now then, tell the people of Judah and of Jerusalem that I am making plans against them and getting ready to punish them. Tell them to stop living sinful lives — to change their ways and the things they are doing. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.18.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.18.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 18:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "They will answer, ‘No, why should we? We will all be just as stubborn and evil as we want to be.’ ”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.18.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.18.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 18:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.18.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.18.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 18:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.18.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.18.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " says,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.18.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.18.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 18:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.18.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.18.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 18:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Then the people said, “Let's do something about Jeremiah! There will always be priests to instruct us, the wise to give us counsel, and prophets to proclaim God's message. Let's bring charges against him, and stop listening to what he says.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.18.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.18.18"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 18:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.18.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.18.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 18:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "So I prayed, “",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.18.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.18.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": ", hear what I am saying and listen to what my enemies are saying about me. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.18.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.18.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 18:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Is evil the payment for good? Yet they have dug a pit for me to fall in. Remember how I came to you and spoke on their behalf, so that you would not deal with them in anger. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.18.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.18.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 18:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "But now, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.18.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.18.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": ", let their children starve to death; let them be killed in war. Let the women lose their husbands and children; let the men die of disease and the young men be killed in battle. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.18.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.18.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 18:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Send a mob to plunder their homes without warning; make them cry out in terror. They have dug a pit for me to fall in and have set traps to catch me. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.18.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.18.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 18:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "But, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.18.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.18.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": ", you know all their plots to kill me. Do not forgive their evil or pardon their sin. Throw them down in defeat and deal with them while you are angry.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.18.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.18.23"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
